        "id": 187696,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-02T23:56:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you are in Gazelle a Form and play Bestial shift you get to activate the Gazelle part of the text. That gives you a 3HP and a power use. &nbsp;Since you used that power to Transform into Crocodile and Bestial Shift is still resolving you get to activate the Crocodile text. &nbsp;That gives you damage and a power use. &nbsp; You chose the Crocodile power and then Bestial Shift finishes. &nbsp;Since you have Natural Born Vigor, Natural Form's Power, and Cornered Beast out you have the ability to still use those powers. &nbsp;So what you had happen is expected behavior. &nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
